        },
        {
          "text": "Khekhuelesie Wele luyali! Anyala khumukhola enywe mwatinya mu lisuubila lienywe, khuloondekhana ne Elomo Endayi eya Yesu Kristo niyo nilwacha ne khuloondekhana khu lifuunula lie bung'ali bubwakukhuulilwa mu mase kamakali kakabira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luno, bung'ali obwo bwarerirwe abuwaanga khubirira mu maandiko ke bang'oosi, lundi bwakholiibwe khumanyikha khu kholo choosi, khulwe Lilaka lia Wele owa mindali nio boosi boole khusuubila ne khuria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
